      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Strength:\r\n  Increases physical damage output. Scales linearly with
    base attack.\r\n\r\nDefense:\r\n  Reduces incoming physical damage with diminishing
    returns (soft cap ~70%).\r\n\r\nMagicDefense:\r\n  Reduces incoming magical damage
    with diminishing returns (soft cap ~70%).\r\n\r\nIntelligence:\r\n  Increases
    magical damage output. Scales linearly with base INT.\r\n\r\nVitality:\r\n  Increases
    maximum health. +10 HP per level, +10 HP per stat point.\r\n  \r\nLuck:\r\n 
    Increases dodge and crit chance with soft caps."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dbff46c173ecca746bd43b30b084ff99, type: 2}
